In this extended version of the `AdvancedSteelBowItem`, I've added functionality for:
- Increasing arrow damage based on how long the player draws the bow.
- Adding fire to arrows if drawn fully (for 100 ticks).
- Consuming ammo in normal gameplay but not in creative mode.
- Playing a shooting sound when an arrow is released.
- Reducing durability of the bow after each shot, unless the player is in creative mode.

The `appendHoverText` method has been overridden to provide additional tooltip information about the bow's properties.
